{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]The Lord bless you and [F]keepyou,
[C]The Lord life [Am]His countenance [G]upon you,
[G7/F]And give you [Em]peace, [C]and give you peace;
[C/G]The Lord the [G7]Lord [Am]make His face [Em]to shine uponyou,
[F]And be [Em]gracious unto you, [Dm]be [C/G]gracious,
[C]The Lord be gracious, gracious unto you.
[F]Amen.
